(5802193, 845031, 112107, '<td valign="top">Ribbon material. <br/>Incredible picture on the best challenge I''ve voted so far.<br/>Fantastic subject, light, monotones and framing.<br/>The picture of a lifetime.<br/>If I''ll ever get a print this is going to be the first.<br/>Added to favorites.</td>', 'Ribbon material. Incredible picture on the best challenge I''ve voted so far.Fantastic subject, light, monotones and framing.The picture of a lifetime.If I''ll ever get a print this is going to be the first.Added to favorites.', '2010-01-08 08:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802196, 843836, 112107, '<td valign="top">Amazing contrast, lighting, subject, composition, you name it.<br/>Everything in this picture is perfect.<br/>The ribbon would be very deserved.</td>', 'Amazing contrast, lighting, subject, composition, you name it.Everything in this picture is perfect.The ribbon would be very deserved.', '2010-01-08 08:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802203, 844868, 112107, '<td valign="top">I started voting this as a 9 probably because of the streak of 10''s I had given shortly but looking at other 9''s I decided to upgrade my vote.<br/> <br/>Another incredible picture in the best challenge I''ve seen since I joined. I wonder how much PP was involved...</td>', 'I started voting this as a 9 probably because of the streak of 10''s I had given shortly but looking at other 9''s I decided to upgrade my vote. Another incredible picture in the best challenge I''ve seen since I joined. I wonder how much PP was involved...', '2010-01-08 08:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802211, 843857, 112107, '<td valign="top">I might have given a 10* here if the crop had done with the burnt highlights on the top left but I understand you didn''t want to crop Merryl Streep''s head off.<br/>Extra points given for going against the tide and doing the exact opposite of wha teverybody else does wtih selective desaturation.<br/>9*</td>', 'I might have given a 10* here if the crop had done with the burnt highlights on the top left but I understand you didn''t want to crop Merryl Streep''s head off.Extra points given for going against the tide and doing the exact opposite of wha teverybody else does wtih selective desaturation.9*', '2010-01-08 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802216, 844168, 104920, '<td valign="top">No you are the master! Great! 10!!!</td>', 'No you are the master! Great! 10!!!', '2010-01-08 08:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802370, 844962, 73235, '<td valign="top">a very tough shot - to get the focus right. If you look closely, the focus is on the girl''s left arm, not her face, where I would have expected it.</td>', 'a very tough shot - to get the focus right. If you look closely, the focus is on the girl''s left arm, not her face, where I would have expected it.', '2010-01-08 11:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
