(5802667, 842856, 42013, '<td valign="top">LOL. its a sudsy afro!</td>', 'LOL. its a sudsy afro!', '2010-01-08 14:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802669, 844979, 42013, '<td valign="top">for real? The slight tilt subtracts for me as do the strong red tones. Otherwise, it''s a solid portrait.</td>', 'for real? The slight tilt subtracts for me as do the strong red tones. Otherwise, it''s a solid portrait.', '2010-01-08 14:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802670, 844980, 42013, '<td valign="top">sad...but I really like it.</td>', 'sad...but I really like it.', '2010-01-08 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802679, 844962, 12733, '<td valign="top">This misses greatness because the woman''s hand obscures the kid''s face. A differnt angle, or a minute''s movement could have improved this picture.</td>', 'This misses greatness because the woman''s hand obscures the kid''s face. A differnt angle, or a minute''s movement could have improved this picture.', '2010-01-08 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802681, 843849, 12733, '<td valign="top">That is quite an expression on your subject''s face. It''s enough to make me want to read the book without knowing anything about it. Nice composition, sharp pic.</td>', 'That is quite an expression on your subject''s face. It''s enough to make me want to read the book without knowing anything about it. Nice composition, sharp pic.', '2010-01-08 14:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802683, 844622, 12733, '<td valign="top">Closer vantage point (or tighter crop) would have improved this shot a lot. It took a moment, even after looking at the title, to figure out what I am seeing.</td>', 'Closer vantage point (or tighter crop) would have improved this shot a lot. It took a moment, even after looking at the title, to figure out what I am seeing.', '2010-01-08 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802685, 844541, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great expression, sharp picture. But the overdone red makeup around her eyes gives it a weird feel.</td>', 'Great expression, sharp picture. But the overdone red makeup around her eyes gives it a weird feel.', '2010-01-08 14:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802687, 845072, 12733, '<td valign="top">Scary eyes!</td>', 'Scary eyes!', '2010-01-08 14:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802689, 843640, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of high key</td>', 'Nice use of high key', '2010-01-08 14:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802692, 844657, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a pretty model; the expression fits the title. But what does the scissors signify?</td>', 'Nice capture of a pretty model; the expression fits the title. But what does the scissors signify?', '2010-01-08 14:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802696, 844805, 12733, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the right to pull her face off center would add a lot to this picture. Otherwise, very nice shot.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the right to pull her face off center would add a lot to this picture. Otherwise, very nice shot.', '2010-01-08 14:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802700, 844122, 12733, '<td valign="top">Too tight over the eyes. The line between deliberately not including the entire face and looking like you just plain missed is very fine, and I think you came out on the wrong side of it.</td>', 'Too tight over the eyes. The line between deliberately not including the entire face and looking like you just plain missed is very fine, and I think you came out on the wrong side of it.', '2010-01-08 14:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802702, 844335, 12733, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the model and the photo tells a story. Nicely done.</td>', 'The contrast between the model and the photo tells a story. Nicely done.', '2010-01-08 14:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802706, 844933, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute model, nicely photographed.</td>', 'Cute model, nicely photographed.', '2010-01-08 14:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802709, 845064, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious setting. I''m not all that crazy about the very bright patch on the left, it pulls attention away from the model and the path.</td>', 'Very mysterious setting. I''m not all that crazy about the very bright patch on the left, it pulls attention away from the model and the path.', '2010-01-08 14:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802711, 844690, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of high key, though the rabbit kind of fades into the background.</td>', 'Very nice use of high key, though the rabbit kind of fades into the background.', '2010-01-08 14:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802713, 845035, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp picture. I think you would give more of a sense of looking around or checking the surroundings if you had cropped him more tightly to the left, so he would be looking into the picture.</td>', 'Nice, sharp picture. I think you would give more of a sense of looking around or checking the surroundings if you had cropped him more tightly to the left, so he would be looking into the picture.', '2010-01-08 14:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802714, 844831, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly lighted background - but you can hardly see their faces, especially the guy on the right.</td>', 'Brilliantly lighted background - but you can hardly see their faces, especially the guy on the right.', '2010-01-08 14:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802715, 844733, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.</td>', 'Nice action shot.', '2010-01-08 14:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802716, 845029, 12733, '<td valign="top">The poster says it all; the picture - including his expression - is ambiguous. I like the sentiment, but I think the person could have expressed the emotion better.<br/>p.s. if I were not already familiar with Billionaires for Bush, I wold have no idea what that bottom line is supposed to mean.</td>', 'The poster says it all; the picture - including his expression - is ambiguous. I like the sentiment, but I think the person could have expressed the emotion better.p.s. if I were not already familiar with Billionaires for Bush, I wold have no idea what that bottom line is supposed to mean.', '2010-01-08 14:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802718, 844713, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a stained glass window, but the person gets kind of lost.</td>', 'Nice shot of a stained glass window, but the person gets kind of lost.', '2010-01-08 14:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802719, 843683, 12733, '<td valign="top">I assume the ashes have some relevance, but the picture doesn''t make it clear.</td>', 'I assume the ashes have some relevance, but the picture doesn''t make it clear.', '2010-01-08 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802722, 842856, 12733, '<td valign="top">Huh???</td>', 'Huh???', '2010-01-08 14:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802724, 844168, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the players.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the players.', '2010-01-08 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802728, 844270, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice group shot, nice atmosphere, but way more than one. The people in the background with their heads cut off are a distraction. Cropping tight to the tops of the heads of the seated people, or shooting from a higher angle, would have eliminated them.</td>', 'Nice group shot, nice atmosphere, but way more than one. The people in the background with their heads cut off are a distraction. Cropping tight to the tops of the heads of the seated people, or shooting from a higher angle, would have eliminated them.', '2010-01-08 14:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802734, 844089, 12733, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the right would add focus to the guitar player. Or, alternatively, cropping away the left wold havehadhim looking into the picture. There''s too much here;the guitar player gets lost.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the right would add focus to the guitar player. Or, alternatively, cropping away the left wold havehadhim looking into the picture. There''s too much here;the guitar player gets lost.', '2010-01-08 14:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802736, 845057, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute.</td>', 'Very cute.', '2010-01-08 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5802739, 845054, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is somewhat over the top for my taste.</td>', 'This is somewhat over the top for my taste.', '2010-01-08 14:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
