(5803208, 844897, 16739, '<td valign="top">very nice   7</td>', 'very nice   7', '2010-01-08 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803218, 844122, 104230, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice for your crop or perhaps the actual setup. Using the title "watcher" suggests we should be paying attention to his man''s eyes so I find it strange that we cannot see more of them. Presumably this was done to be intentionally disconcerting.  I will come back to this again later to see if I like it more the second time around...</td>', 'Interesting choice for your crop or perhaps the actual setup. Using the title "watcher" suggests we should be paying attention to his man''s eyes so I find it strange that we cannot see more of them. Presumably this was done to be intentionally disconcerting.  I will come back to this again later to see if I like it more the second time around...', '2010-01-08 22:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803278, 843857, 111808, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the brightly lit and colourful transport and the black and white person is very effective at emphasising the theme of Loneliness. It seems she is isolated, apart, and this is echoed by both her expression and her closed in body stance. It is a very visual and definite contrast and if you look at her reflection in the window you can see two other passengers in completely different miens - one is engaged in reading his newspaper, the other is looking forward. This woman is not. The poster stating "It''s complicated...something''s gotta give" is an additional nice touch as it most probably sums up the subject''s inner emotions. Engaging - I want to know more of her story. Superb capture, eloquent photograph.</td>', 'The contrast between the brightly lit and colourful transport and the black and white person is very effective at emphasising the theme of Loneliness. It seems she is isolated, apart, and this is echoed by both her expression and her closed in body stance. It is a very visual and definite contrast and if you look at her reflection in the window you can see two other passengers in completely different miens - one is engaged in reading his newspaper, the other is looking forward. This woman is not. The poster stating "It''s complicated...something''s gotta give" is an additional nice touch as it most probably sums up the subject''s inner emotions. Engaging - I want to know more of her story. Superb capture, eloquent photograph.', '2010-01-08 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803284, 844335, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the contrasts in this - there is beauty in both Ages and her eyes still glitter and shine.</td>', 'Love the contrasts in this - there is beauty in both Ages and her eyes still glitter and shine.', '2010-01-08 23:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803285, 843982, 111808, '<td valign="top">It will be a most different world if there is ever equality without regard to differences or gender. I love your concept because each one of us has the right to Love, and we do not always know who that might turn out to be.</td>', 'It will be a most different world if there is ever equality without regard to differences or gender. I love your concept because each one of us has the right to Love, and we do not always know who that might turn out to be.', '2010-01-08 23:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803286, 845029, 111808, '<td valign="top">Ah, the POV of the common Man on Main Street. A photograph that makes one think about other possibilities..</td>', 'Ah, the POV of the common Man on Main Street. A photograph that makes one think about other possibilities..', '2010-01-08 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803298, 844980, 111808, '<td valign="top">These hands are very expressive and have seen many years of work and Love. This is a different take on the challenge but more than that it is a beautifully captured photograph. The ribbing of the sweater enhances the texture of the the hands also as it echoes the shading on them.</td>', 'These hands are very expressive and have seen many years of work and Love. This is a different take on the challenge but more than that it is a beautifully captured photograph. The ribbing of the sweater enhances the texture of the the hands also as it echoes the shading on them.', '2010-01-08 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803307, 842856, 111808, '<td valign="top">Were it not for your caption, I probably would NOT have known exactly what this was. When I keyed into it, my first thought was that it was definitely much different than most here in the challenge. The eyes are most interesting but the rest of the face looks much like an ogre. The detergent soap bubbles are a nice touch around it as is the sepia almost coffee coloured toning.</td>', 'Were it not for your caption, I probably would NOT have known exactly what this was. When I keyed into it, my first thought was that it was definitely much different than most here in the challenge. The eyes are most interesting but the rest of the face looks much like an ogre. The detergent soap bubbles are a nice touch around it as is the sepia almost coffee coloured toning.', '2010-01-08 23:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803316, 843484, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is quite expressive and it aptly displays this man''s opinion of the new year or at least the moment and his life - or perhaps it is just his view of public transportation.</td>', 'This is quite expressive and it aptly displays this man''s opinion of the new year or at least the moment and his life - or perhaps it is just his view of public transportation.', '2010-01-08 23:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
