(5803614, 843683, 101702, '<td valign="top">A really pretty model but I can''t help thinking the ashes actually detract from the shot rather than add anything. Perhaps if there was some contect for the ashes it might make more sense... i.e. a burning building in the background or something like that.</td>', 'A really pretty model but I can''t help thinking the ashes actually detract from the shot rather than add anything. Perhaps if there was some contect for the ashes it might make more sense... i.e. a burning building in the background or something like that.', '2010-01-09 09:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803616, 844661, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''d have given an extra point if the focus had been better</td>', 'I''d have given an extra point if the focus had been better', '2010-01-09 09:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803617, 844122, 101702, '<td valign="top">Some fill in flash to bring the eyes out would improve this shot in my opinion</td>', 'Some fill in flash to bring the eyes out would improve this shot in my opinion', '2010-01-09 10:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803619, 844270, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a much tighter crop bringing the two chaps in the foreground towards the edge of the frame and bringing the top down to around the head height of all the sitting people. I suppose this is a very subjective thing though. Nice clarity and focus, and vivid colours.</td>', 'I''d prefer a much tighter crop bringing the two chaps in the foreground towards the edge of the frame and bringing the top down to around the head height of all the sitting people. I suppose this is a very subjective thing though. Nice clarity and focus, and vivid colours.', '2010-01-09 10:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803620, 844979, 101702, '<td valign="top">Can''t help feeling that this would benefit from being level. Seems to list to one side... might be my eyes I guess.</td>', 'Can''t help feeling that this would benefit from being level. Seems to list to one side... might be my eyes I guess.', '2010-01-09 10:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803630, 844945, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light on her face. Love the blurred snowy background. Nicely tells something about her.</td>', 'Beautiful light on her face. Love the blurred snowy background. Nicely tells something about her.', '2010-01-09 10:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803631, 844805, 88204, '<td valign="top">Neat portrait. I like the inclusion of her hand for balance. It''s harsh light but the positioning of her face to the light makes it work well.</td>', 'Neat portrait. I like the inclusion of her hand for balance. It''s harsh light but the positioning of her face to the light makes it work well.', '2010-01-09 10:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803636, 844270, 88204, '<td valign="top">Excellent story telling shot. I wish there man in front was making eye contact with the camera so we could think of it as his story. Right now it''s "a" story with the subject being the scene rather than a person. Still a great shot. 8</td>', 'Excellent story telling shot. I wish there man in front was making eye contact with the camera so we could think of it as his story. Right now it''s "a" story with the subject being the scene rather than a person. Still a great shot. 8', '2010-01-09 10:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803638, 843982, 88204, '<td valign="top">Excellent story. I wish we could see their faces to make it a litle more personal.</td>', 'Excellent story. I wish we could see their faces to make it a litle more personal.', '2010-01-09 10:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803639, 844662, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. I love the colors. I''m not sure what story it tells but I like the shot and it shows her as a unique person. 8</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. I love the colors. I''m not sure what story it tells but I like the shot and it shows her as a unique person. 8', '2010-01-09 10:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
