(5803966, 843857, 37845, '<td valign="top">Whoa... ghostly. This almost gives me chills.</td>', 'Whoa... ghostly. This almost gives me chills.', '2010-01-09 16:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803971, 845067, 89230, '<td valign="top">While it is likely this photo was taken ''in the moment'' it wouldve been nice to see her eye. Well done in having here be roughly 1/3 of the photo and looking into it.</td>', 'While it is likely this photo was taken ''in the moment'' it wouldve been nice to see her eye. Well done in having here be roughly 1/3 of the photo and looking into it.', '2010-01-09 16:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803973, 845035, 89230, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. I think it wouldve worked better if your subject was facking the camera with the artillery as the background. Stay safe + thank you</td>', 'Very nice capture. I think it wouldve worked better if your subject was facking the camera with the artillery as the background. Stay safe + thank you', '2010-01-09 16:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803975, 843683, 37845, '<td valign="top">Great portrait, the lighting is good, as are the skin tones. However, she looks too clean to be dirty (if that makes any sense). The ashes look unnatural.</td>', 'Great portrait, the lighting is good, as are the skin tones. However, she looks too clean to be dirty (if that makes any sense). The ashes look unnatural.', '2010-01-09 16:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803977, 843843, 89230, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo that will probably be underappreciated by the DP crowd, probably due to the lack of a major Wow factor. Either way, nice photo!</td>', 'This is a great photo that will probably be underappreciated by the DP crowd, probably due to the lack of a major Wow factor. Either way, nice photo!', '2010-01-09 16:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803979, 844639, 89230, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. The only recommendation that I would have would be that, in Advanced Editing you couldve removed the bit of hair running across the right side of her face (under her eye).</td>', 'What a great capture. The only recommendation that I would have would be that, in Advanced Editing you couldve removed the bit of hair running across the right side of her face (under her eye).', '2010-01-09 16:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803983, 844038, 89230, '<td valign="top">I wouldve been nice to see her face. I also think your white balance might be off a bit, but it could be my monitor</td>', 'I wouldve been nice to see her face. I also think your white balance might be off a bit, but it could be my monitor', '2010-01-09 16:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803985, 844963, 89230, '<td valign="top">I definately like this. In my opinion, there is too much space on the left.</td>', 'I definately like this. In my opinion, there is too much space on the left.', '2010-01-09 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803986, 844239, 89230, '<td valign="top">I think you have a real fantastic photo on your hands here. I would highly recommend a tighter crop next time. I think there is too much space on the left, and even a bit on top. I dont care whats on the left, so why show it so much?</td>', 'I think you have a real fantastic photo on your hands here. I would highly recommend a tighter crop next time. I think there is too much space on the left, and even a bit on top. I dont care whats on the left, so why show it so much?', '2010-01-09 16:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803990, 844335, 89230, '<td valign="top">love the idea! I think the lighting throws me off a bit. The top right is bright, while she is darker. The eye is drawn to the bright part of the picture, which in this case is not your subject. I think it would also be cool to give her the same pose as in the photograph in the picture?</td>', 'love the idea! I think the lighting throws me off a bit. The top right is bright, while she is darker. The eye is drawn to the bright part of the picture, which in this case is not your subject. I think it would also be cool to give her the same pose as in the photograph in the picture?', '2010-01-09 16:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803994, 844980, 89230, '<td valign="top">Sometimes simple is the best. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes simple is the best. Well done.', '2010-01-09 16:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803997, 844270, 89230, '<td valign="top">If selling the peas is the subject, I would probably recommend cropping the right side a bit. I dont think you would loose too much by doing that, and cropping down the top to bring the photograph in the same proportions... this way you have more of a focus on the pea sellers, instead of all the distractions in the background.</td>', 'If selling the peas is the subject, I would probably recommend cropping the right side a bit. I dont think you would loose too much by doing that, and cropping down the top to bring the photograph in the same proportions... this way you have more of a focus on the pea sellers, instead of all the distractions in the background.', '2010-01-09 16:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5803999, 845054, 89230, '<td valign="top">cool concept.</td>', 'cool concept.', '2010-01-09 16:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804006, 845045, 89230, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo, but also appears too plain. I think you could probably play with the levels a bit to make this POP, while not loosing too much of the scene in over-editing. Good capture</td>', 'I think this is a great photo, but also appears too plain. I think you could probably play with the levels a bit to make this POP, while not loosing too much of the scene in over-editing. Good capture', '2010-01-09 16:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804008, 844713, 89230, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. It wouldve been nice for it to be straight. I can see you judged straight by the right side of the window, but it still looks crooked. Its always difficult (for me anyways) to decide where to base ''level'' on.</td>', 'I like this a lot. It wouldve been nice for it to be straight. I can see you judged straight by the right side of the window, but it still looks crooked. Its always difficult (for me anyways) to decide where to base ''level'' on.', '2010-01-09 16:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
