(5804326, 845011, 81362, '<td valign="top">Wood ducks always seem so striking. The nice reflections make me wish for a composition without the ones standing on the ice.</td>', 'Wood ducks always seem so striking. The nice reflections make me wish for a composition without the ones standing on the ice.', '2010-01-09 22:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804329, 844165, 81362, '<td valign="top">Captures a lot of energy. I wonder if a little space to the left of hair/head would give more sense of action (seems a little static with the hair lined up exactly with the edge).</td>', 'Captures a lot of energy. I wonder if a little space to the left of hair/head would give more sense of action (seems a little static with the hair lined up exactly with the edge).', '2010-01-09 22:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804333, 844993, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and good handling of irregular light. I''m imagining it might have been stronger if taken from a little further to the right, eliminating the green leaves/red flower and making that nice wall occupy the entire background. High score anyway.</td>', 'Nice detail and good handling of irregular light. I''m imagining it might have been stronger if taken from a little further to the right, eliminating the green leaves/red flower and making that nice wall occupy the entire background. High score anyway.', '2010-01-09 22:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804341, 844690, 81362, '<td valign="top">Nice smile. Would like to see more detail in the rabbit fur (maybe exposing a little lower and/or aiming light from the side).</td>', 'Nice smile. Would like to see more detail in the rabbit fur (maybe exposing a little lower and/or aiming light from the side).', '2010-01-09 22:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804344, 845009, 81362, '<td valign="top">Spooky eyes.</td>', 'Spooky eyes.', '2010-01-09 22:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804351, 844911, 81362, '<td valign="top">Windblow hair effect works well here. Side light brings out nice features. The shaded side of her face shows that eye well. The shadow at her left eye is harsh enough to be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Windblow hair effect works well here. Side light brings out nice features. The shaded side of her face shows that eye well. The shadow at her left eye is harsh enough to be a bit distracting.', '2010-01-09 22:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804431, 844113, 102024, '<td valign="top">I think at the heart of this challenge lies the element of exploring individuality amidst the sea of people that populate this planet.  That being said, I think omitting the face of your subject drastically removes the individualism that a human face brings to a photograph.</td>', 'I think at the heart of this challenge lies the element of exploring individuality amidst the sea of people that populate this planet.  That being said, I think omitting the face of your subject drastically removes the individualism that a human face brings to a photograph.', '2010-01-09 23:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804432, 843860, 102024, '<td valign="top">But why is the pain important to the story of this person?  What sort of story could be told here?</td>', 'But why is the pain important to the story of this person?  What sort of story could be told here?', '2010-01-09 23:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804436, 844956, 102024, '<td valign="top">I really wish there was more of a story told through the photograph.  What makes him the real Santa?  Does he represent something greater to others?  Does he bestow gifts upon strangers?  I think so much more could have been portrayed here</td>', 'I really wish there was more of a story told through the photograph.  What makes him the real Santa?  Does he represent something greater to others?  Does he bestow gifts upon strangers?  I think so much more could have been portrayed here', '2010-01-09 23:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804439, 845031, 102024, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely!  One of my favorites in this challenge</td>', 'Absolutely lovely!  One of my favorites in this challenge', '2010-01-09 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804441, 844168, 102024, '<td valign="top">Definitely a good story being told here.  However, I feel like the post processing, the black shirt, and how it blends into the background sort of make it seem like his head is just floating apart from his body... and that kinda bothers me.</td>', 'Definitely a good story being told here.  However, I feel like the post processing, the black shirt, and how it blends into the background sort of make it seem like his head is just floating apart from his body... and that kinda bothers me.', '2010-01-09 23:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804443, 843857, 102024, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure it is necessary that she be black and white.</td>', 'I''m not so sure it is necessary that she be black and white.', '2010-01-09 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804444, 845063, 102024, '<td valign="top">I love land art!  Andy Goldsworthy''s work inspires me.  This portrait gives me the subject, and gives me their story; one of the few that fits the challenge in my humble opinion.</td>', 'I love land art!  Andy Goldsworthy''s work inspires me.  This portrait gives me the subject, and gives me their story; one of the few that fits the challenge in my humble opinion.', '2010-01-09 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804446, 843349, 102024, '<td valign="top">I get the story, but I think it is a little vague in the photo itself.  Perhaps if there was some more emphasis on the subjects new found situation through a careful choice of the objects in the scene...</td>', 'I get the story, but I think it is a little vague in the photo itself.  Perhaps if there was some more emphasis on the subjects new found situation through a careful choice of the objects in the scene...', '2010-01-09 23:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804506, 844663, 28882, '<td valign="top">i really like this one.  i think it''s the shallow dof and cool colors.</td>', 'i really like this one.  i think it''s the shallow dof and cool colors.', '2010-01-10 01:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804559, 844168, 84945, '<td valign="top">Wonderful character in the old man''s face, but to me the processing makes the head appear as if it had been pasted into a different photo.</td>', 'Wonderful character in the old man''s face, but to me the processing makes the head appear as if it had been pasted into a different photo.', '2010-01-10 04:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804568, 844951, 84945, '<td valign="top">A perfect example of how these creatures control us with their eyes, but the challenge specified a "person", so for me this DNMC.</td>', 'A perfect example of how these creatures control us with their eyes, but the challenge specified a "person", so for me this DNMC.', '2010-01-10 04:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804618, 845035, 30791, '<td valign="top">Al Asad?<br/>MAG compound?</td>', 'Al Asad?MAG compound?', '2010-01-10 08:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804621, 844977, 105130, '<td valign="top">I just came back to bump this up a point. It just seems so strikingly personal, while at the same time the fact that his face is covered adds an element of privacy. Fantastic work and congratulations.</td>', 'I just came back to bump this up a point. It just seems so strikingly personal, while at the same time the fact that his face is covered adds an element of privacy. Fantastic work and congratulations.', '2010-01-10 08:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804622, 844541, 102519, '<td valign="top">love this shot as much as the other one in the paul simon lyrics challange, it really catches me with the clolors/make up and fruits. wicked hairdo and nice eyes.....</td>', 'love this shot as much as the other one in the paul simon lyrics challange, it really catches me with the clolors/make up and fruits. wicked hairdo and nice eyes.....', '2010-01-10 08:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804659, 844122, 28427, '<td valign="top">The crop doesn''t do it justice i.m.h.o. <br/>Meaning: what bothers me is the cut right through his right eye and just above the left eye.  His right ear is cut as well but somehow this bothers me less than the eyes.</td>', 'The crop doesn''t do it justice i.m.h.o. Meaning: what bothers me is the cut right through his right eye and just above the left eye.  His right ear is cut as well but somehow this bothers me less than the eyes.', '2010-01-10 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804690, 845054, 37845, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites in this challenge. Im looking forward to learning how you pulled this one off.</td>', 'One of my favourites in this challenge. Im looking forward to learning how you pulled this one off.', '2010-01-10 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804691, 845060, 37845, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous portrait. The smile is very genuine, and the skin tones are perfect.</td>', 'Gorgeous portrait. The smile is very genuine, and the skin tones are perfect.', '2010-01-10 09:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804693, 844980, 37845, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge. I like that you took a different route, and photographed body parts rather than the face. His hands have a lot of character, and certainly a story to tell. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge. I like that you took a different route, and photographed body parts rather than the face. His hands have a lot of character, and certainly a story to tell. Good luck in the challenge.', '2010-01-10 09:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5804697, 842856, 113238, '<td valign="top">This would be great under the humor contest : )</td>', 'This would be great under the humor contest : )', '2010-01-10 10:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805091, 844988, 103032, '<td valign="top">I find this photo very compelling in that I want to know what his story is about.  The guy is interesting in that he seems very happy, but I wonder what the story is behind the tattooed words on his chest up to his neck.  The lower POV view is great/different.  The person framed by the two horses adds to his "story."  Great choice to go B&amp;W.  One of my few 10''s and one of my favorites in this challenge.  Hoping for this to ribbon.  Please give us the story behind him in your notes.</td>', 'I find this photo very compelling in that I want to know what his story is about.  The guy is interesting in that he seems very happy, but I wonder what the story is behind the tattooed words on his chest up to his neck.  The lower POV view is great/different.  The person framed by the two horses adds to his "story."  Great choice to go B&W.  One of my few 10''s and one of my favorites in this challenge.  Hoping for this to ribbon.  Please give us the story behind him in your notes.', '2010-01-10 18:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805095, 845047, 103032, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Like the low point of view.  Like how you framed him and included the sidewalk and surrounding environment to give the image context; good DOF.  Even without the title, the image has a compelling story behind it.  One of a few 10''s from me.  I think this should ribbon.</td>', 'Great shot.  Like the low point of view.  Like how you framed him and included the sidewalk and surrounding environment to give the image context; good DOF.  Even without the title, the image has a compelling story behind it.  One of a few 10''s from me.  I think this should ribbon.', '2010-01-10 18:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805098, 844979, 103032, '<td valign="top">The image is well done.  The colors are rich; focus is great; HDR?  The composition is balanced, nice symmetry.  Well presented image, 7.  With that said, I just don''t find a "compelling story" behind the photo.  Maybe if this was taken say five years ago, I would have said wow.  But the subject of a soldier on Saddam''s throne seems over done.  It seems every soldier/contractor who''s been deployed has the obligatory pic on the throne and there are hundreds of pics of someone on the throne (albeit not well done as this image).  I guess the casual pose doesn''t give me a sense of a "compelling story."  Just this viewer''s opinion...</td>', 'The image is well done.  The colors are rich; focus is great; HDR?  The composition is balanced, nice symmetry.  Well presented image, 7.  With that said, I just don''t find a "compelling story" behind the photo.  Maybe if this was taken say five years ago, I would have said wow.  But the subject of a soldier on Saddam''s throne seems over done.  It seems every soldier/contractor who''s been deployed has the obligatory pic on the throne and there are hundreds of pics of someone on the throne (albeit not well done as this image).  I guess the casual pose doesn''t give me a sense of a "compelling story."  Just this viewer''s opinion...', '2010-01-10 18:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805215, 844622, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love how the water turned out in this pic....</td>', 'I love how the water turned out in this pic....', '2010-01-10 20:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805217, 844239, 46918, '<td valign="top">I love how the colors work together...Good job.</td>', 'I love how the colors work together...Good job.', '2010-01-10 21:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5805219, 844814, 46918, '<td valign="top">Good quality shot... great vibrant colors....It really just does not pop to me...</td>', 'Good quality shot... great vibrant colors....It really just does not pop to me...', '2010-01-10 21:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
