(5805982, 843982, 32767, '<td valign="top">It''s a storyteller but doesn''t really qualify as a portrait, as I define it. Curious why you cropped out their feet?</td>', 'It''s a storyteller but doesn''t really qualify as a portrait, as I define it. Curious why you cropped out their feet?', '2010-01-11 10:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5806088, 845063, 69192, '<td valign="top">Seems like your depth of field fell just short of your main subject.  If he''d been sitting off to the side, not looking at the camera and the rocks were the main subject, I think this aperture choice would have worked better.</td>', 'Seems like your depth of field fell just short of your main subject.  If he''d been sitting off to the side, not looking at the camera and the rocks were the main subject, I think this aperture choice would have worked better.', '2010-01-11 11:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
