(5807545, 844714, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was about ready to click the 4 or 5 key and press on, but something got me to looking again. First impression is just a good snapshot, however there is more than that. It shows who this woman is and portrays her in her home. No, this is not an exotic and fascinating person from a far part of the world, in fact, she could live down the street from me. Something about this makes it stand out the more I look at it. Maybe because she seems so familiar.</td>', 'I was about ready to click the 4 or 5 key and press on, but something got me to looking again. First impression is just a good snapshot, however there is more than that. It shows who this woman is and portrays her in her home. No, this is not an exotic and fascinating person from a far part of the world, in fact, she could live down the street from me. Something about this makes it stand out the more I look at it. Maybe because she seems so familiar.', '2010-01-12 13:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5807549, 844335, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find it interesting that I can look at a photo of someone when they were younger and tell which person in a group is them, but I have no clue as to what their features will look like when they get older.</td>', 'I find it interesting that I can look at a photo of someone when they were younger and tell which person in a group is them, but I have no clue as to what their features will look like when they get older.', '2010-01-12 13:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
