(5808158, 844541, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hi, Will. Of course you knew that using the same model and makeup in two consecutive challenges gave away some degree of anonymity. Nice melons.<br/> <br/>Hmm, on second thought, this could also be an entry from Connor or Kingskingdom, since all 3 of you shoot together. (I suppose that helps save on model fees.) Quit confusing me so much!<br/> <br/>I generally like this, great smile, but her makeup I find too bizarre. That''s just a preference thing, though, and not really any flaw.</td>', 'Hi, Will. Of course you knew that using the same model and makeup in two consecutive challenges gave away some degree of anonymity. Nice melons. Hmm, on second thought, this could also be an entry from Connor or Kingskingdom, since all 3 of you shoot together. (I suppose that helps save on model fees.) Quit confusing me so much! I generally like this, great smile, but her makeup I find too bizarre. That''s just a preference thing, though, and not really any flaw.', '2010-01-12 20:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5808174, 844122, 90414, '<td valign="top">Seems like a very strange crop...</td>', 'Seems like a very strange crop...', '2010-01-12 21:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
