(5808387, 844786, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite so far. It tells a great story with interesting composition, perfect lighting that highlights both the subject and is interesting in the background. Great backlighting on the subject too. Great shot! 10</td>', 'This is my favorite so far. It tells a great story with interesting composition, perfect lighting that highlights both the subject and is interesting in the background. Great backlighting on the subject too. Great shot! 10', '2010-01-12 23:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
