(5808591, 845060, 39427, '<td valign="top">how cool you get to shoot an exciting model like this!  The portrait is so very natural - she looks classic.  Not sure why it didn''t score higher but great stuff</td>', 'how cool you get to shoot an exciting model like this!  The portrait is so very natural - she looks classic.  Not sure why it didn''t score higher but great stuff', '2010-01-13 00:29:42.000000', NULL, 0),
